# The game server address the client connects to.
# On Vercel, set this in Project Settings > Environment Variables.
# Locally, leave it unset: the dev server serves the client and the game on one port.
# To test a production-style client build against the live server, put it in .env.client.local.
VITE_SERVER_URL=https://quiz-battle-r2kv.onrender.com
